==English==

===Verb===
{{en-verb|runs aground|running aground|ran aground|run aground}}

# {{label|en|intransitive}} For a vessel to be immobilized by water too shallow to allow it to float.
#* ''The ship '''ran aground''' and had to be towed back out to sea.''
# {{label|en|transitive}} To cause a vessel to run aground.
#* ''The drunken [[helmsman]] '''ran''' the ship '''aground.'''''

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|beach}}
* {{l|en|ground}}

